                <pb facs="0491" n="403" xml:id="pg403"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3781: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Welles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-09-07T20:00:00-05:00">September 7, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>210. A meeting is called for 10 o’clock tonight at the Palace which will be
                    attended by the leaders of all political groups. I am reliably informed that the
                    revolutionary group in control will then turn over the Government and I am
                    further advised that President Céspedes will be restored as head of the
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
